WEBVTT

00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:00.468
(Applause)

00:03:00.509 --> 00:03:01.719
Thank you.

00:03:01.719 --> 00:03:03.137
(Applause)

00:03:03.179 --> 00:03:04.555
It's vulnerable.

00:03:04.555 --> 00:03:06.307
I feel like it's a thing people say

00:03:06.349 --> 00:03:09.227
when conversation gets, kind of,
boring at parties, you know,

00:03:09.227 --> 00:03:11.229
they're like, "Did you hear there's an app

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.522
where you can see
who looks at your Instagram?"

00:03:13.522 --> 00:03:14.899
It's like, that's not funny.

00:03:14.899 --> 00:03:17.068
It's not funny,
it's not a cool thing to say.

00:03:17.902 --> 00:03:21.447
I feel like there are people here
who have been married for 40 years, like,

00:03:21.447 --> 00:03:23.241
"What the hell is she talking about?"

00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:24.533
Yeah, it's complicated now.

00:03:24.575 --> 00:03:25.868
It's gotten complicated in.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.788
(Laughter)

00:03:29.121 --> 00:03:31.290
Audience: We’re not so ancient!